GAME CONTENT

AoM Retold Tracker was created under Microsoft's "Game Content Usage Rules" using assets from Age of Mythology:
Retold, and it is not endorsed by or affiliated with Microsoft. Age of Mythology is a trademark of Microsoft. It is
not affiliated with World's Edge or Valve.

The website ships material from the game: the badge images (packed in app/art), the game's texts and Steam's
achievement list for the game, copied by tools/export from an installed copy, and the public lists of the game's
servers in app/data/server.json, read by tools/server-data.mjs. That material is not covered by this program's
license: see app/art/NOTICE.txt. The desktop app also reads the badge images and the game's texts from the player's
own installation, and the player's progress from the game's own folder and the player's own Steam client.


